# Implementation Guidelines (`.did/implement/.hooks/show`)

- **Work Tracking Goal**: All tasks in `.did/implement/` track active implementation work.
- **Completion Mandate**: All items in `.did/implement/` must be resolved (`did done`) before work is finalized.
- **Sub-Task Creation**: If additional work or bug fixes are discovered for a task, create a new sub-issue inside `.did/implement/`.
- **Demotion on Open Questions**: If a task requires further clarification, demote it back to `.did/refine/` (`did mv implement/<task> refine/<task>`).
